    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79880" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρωνῠμ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρωνυμιάζω</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				84.28
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			), etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			intr., <i>to be of like signification with</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.486
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.39
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>to have a corresponding name</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>in Nic.</u>
				p.15
			</span></i> P.</div>
